@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 注册（再次执行应为 409）
POST {{base}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"tom","password":"123456"}

### 2. 登录，HTTP Client 自动保存 Session Cookie
POST {{base}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"tom","password":"123456"}

### 3. 添加书籍，将返回 ID 保存为 bookId
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Java 入门","author":"示例作者","totalPages":100}

> {% client.global.set("bookId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 4. 修改进度
PUT {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"readPages":100}

### 5. 单本详情
GET {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}

### 6. 分页列表
GET {{base}}/books?page=1&size=2

### 7. 搜索
GET {{base}}/books/search?keyword=Java

### 8. 统计
GET {{base}}/books/stats

### 9. 删除
DELETE {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}

### 10. 删除后查询应为 404
GET {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}

### 11. 注销
POST {{base}}/user/logout

### 12. 注销后查询应为 401
GET {{base}}/books
